 - **Leaf vs. Voxel:** The base case specialization (`ChildNodeLevel=0`) operates on leaf nodes or tiles, not individual voxels. `LeafT::TOTAL` defines the DDA step size for the leaf node dimension [S1, S2, unofficial].
 
